{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457940/extras/7238af774a60fd34cf64efe7fd2c535e.poster.avif?t=1757715450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457940/extras/7238af774a60fd34cf64efe7fd2c535e.webm?t=1757715450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457940/extras/7238af774a60fd34cf64efe7fd2c535e.mp4?t=1757715450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Stop saying that! I don\u2019t know how or why I\u2019m here and nothing about this place makes any sense..!&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunn awakens as some sort of bunny in a strange world with no memories of what happened. Explore this surreal landscape and uncover the truth about your identity, using new abilities like Bunny Hopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FUNKYHEART is a 3D platformer........... Explore this surreal world as you confront your identity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And meet funky characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze</strong> obstacles and utilize your <strong>Bunny Hop</strong> to navigate this surreal landscape!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457940/extras/d20a148b414a2e625c48c7b5e839c47f.poster.avif?t=1757715450\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457940/extras/d20a148b414a2e625c48c7b5e839c47f.webm?t=1757715450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\">